00:01:57.480 --> 00:02:00.860
After Father Burke and Sister Irene discover
the books, there's a deleted of the Father

00:02:00.861 --> 00:02:04.470
first taking a look at them, where we can
also see some kind of mask?

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:07.570
It kind of reminds me of the Sunny Family
