00:02:07.570 --> 00:02:11.140
Sister Irene asks why they don't just destroy
the books, and this is the Father's response.

00:02:11.140 --> 00:02:18.170
"There's a belief in certain circles that
destroying any object with magic could release

00:02:18.170 --> 00:02:20.819
whatever power is believed to be stowed inside."

00:02:20.819 --> 00:02:25.090
This is a reference to Ed Warren's belief
that he explains in the Conjuring as the reason

00:02:25.090 --> 00:02:27.950
