a room.

00:02:27.950 --> 00:02:30.300
"Well why not just throw them in an incinerator?"

00:02:30.320 --> 00:02:32.489
"Destroying them would only destroy the vessel.

00:02:32.489 --> 00:02:36.400
Sometimes it's better to keep the genie in
the bottle."

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:40.280
I would speculate these books from the Abbey
could eventually make their way into the Warren's

00:02:40.280 --> 00:02:41.440
room of cursed objects.

00:02:41.440 --> 00:02:45.620
The father also further explains something
I brought up in the previous episodes on The

00:02:45.620 --> 00:02:48.240
Nun, which was this symbol of the snake eating
its tail.

00:02:48.240 --> 00:02:52.190
I had mentioned that the snake is a reference
