00:04:25.759 --> 00:04:28.849
If you've been following my Things You Missed
coverage of The Nun, you'll know that Valak

00:04:28.849 --> 00:04:32.900
is based off of a demon known as the President
of Hell, as told in the real-life book, The

00:04:32.900 --> 00:04:34.099
Lesser Key of Solomon.

00:04:34.099 --> 00:04:39.060
In that book, Valak is described as an angelically
winged boy riding a two-headed dragon, attributed

00:04:39.060 --> 00:04:40.849
with the power of finding treasures.

00:04:40.849 --> 00:04:44.869
The Nun form of Valak is actually something
that's unique to The Conjuring movies, and

00:04:44.869 --> 00:04:48.909
when I saw these demon-like forms in the texts
found by Father Burke, I speculated that Valak

00:04:48.909 --> 00:04:51.500
has the ability to change among many forms.

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:54.280
This scene where all the Nuns are praying
is extended to confirm my suspicions.

00:04:55.800 --> 00:04:57.080
"It takes many forms.

00:04:58.240 --> 00:04:59.240
A serpent.

00:04:59.240 --> 00:04:59.880
A small child.

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:02.160
A demon.

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:05.880
But the form the evil takes the most is..."

00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:07.719
"A nun!"

00:05:07.719 --> 00:05:11.189
Someone in the comments also pointed out that
the demon form of Valak can be seen briefly

00:05:11.189 --> 00:05:15.360
