this statue suddenly has wings.

00:05:19.819 --> 00:05:24.409
The Nuns also go onto explain to Sister Irene
that The Abyss lost her life and soul going

00:05:24.409 --> 00:05:25.409
up against Valak.

00:05:25.409 --> 00:05:28.969
When I first saw the Nun I had assumed that
most of the Nun spirits she encounters at

00:05:28.969 --> 00:05:32.660
they Abbey are manifestations of Valak, but
with the addition of this scene, I'd say that

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:36.369
most of them are there to help her, and the
Abyss is possibly the only one she encounters

00:05:36.369 --> 00:05:38.119
that's being controlled by Valak.

